{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 240,
    "dDurationMs": 7620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Want to become an astrophysicist, hopefully this video will seal the deal either that you definitely should or definitely should not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13780,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's episode is a bit different. I'm going to tell you how to become an astrophysicist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18420,
    "dDurationMs": 6599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a slightly unique perspective on this not because I did it myself but because I spent the past several years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25359,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sitting on and then running the physics PhD admissions committee for one of the largest universities in the u.s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31800,
    "dDurationMs": 2069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have an idea of what it takes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34300,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I thought I'd share some of the stuff I've learned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36820,
    "dDurationMs": 4099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe some of this will be useful to anyone thinking of chasing this silly path"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41110,
    "dDurationMs": 2689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But also to those of you just curious about the process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44410,
    "dDurationMs": 5419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might come out of this even happier that you didn't go down this rather unforgiving rabbit hole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50140,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna end with some astrophysics that we can all try a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54550,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Challenge question for our recent episodes on the eternally inflating universe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59649,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me start by telling you about my own path. It was typical enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64290,
    "dDurationMs": 6750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I started out with a deep fascination in physics in understanding the nuts and bolts of how the universe works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71040,
    "dDurationMs": 4139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I knew that I had to study physics at university, but honestly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75180,
    "dDurationMs": 4529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had no expectation of becoming a career. I just needed to know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80530,
    "dDurationMs": 6529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I caught the bug and decided to try my luck at the most fun film in physics astrophysics. I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87970,
    "dDurationMs": 6079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sent out applications to grad school all outside of Australia because I had a major edge to travel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94049,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got some rejections and got some offers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97570,
    "dDurationMs": 7159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ultimately deciding to head to NASA's Space Telescope Science Institute in Baltimore, which is a great town"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104729,
    "dDurationMs": 6270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the way, even in undergrad I was no longer the smartest person in the room, but in grad school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111040,
    "dDurationMs": 2539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I sometimes wondered if I was the dumbest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114189,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "serious ego check serious impostor syndrome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117280,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which I still experience regularly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119500,
    "dDurationMs": 5599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll get used to that but I told myself that if I'm always the smartest person in the room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125100,
    "dDurationMs": 6629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I'm probably in the wrong room grad school had massive ups and downs and I thought of quitting plenty of times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132849,
    "dDurationMs": 1411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was amazing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134260,
    "dDurationMs": 5639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was using the Hubble Space Telescope to help unravel the connection between quasars and galaxies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140389,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As many others also found the two evolved hand-in-hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144310,
    "dDurationMs": 5819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each influencing the other it was so cool to work on an unknown problem like that, finally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150129,
    "dDurationMs": 6210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I scratched together a thesis and the University gave me a balloon. I had to rent the Hatton robe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156340,
    "dDurationMs": 4979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was a newly minted astrophysicist and through connections. I'm an in grad school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161319,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I scored a nice job working with the Gemini observatories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165200,
    "dDurationMs": 6139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was a postdoctoral position a postdoc which means a short-term job typically two to four years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171769,
    "dDurationMs": 7130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most astrophysicists do a couple of postdocs before looking for permanent jobs as that first postdoc was winding down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178909,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had more thoughts of quitting astrophysics. I was just feeling burned out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184269,
    "dDurationMs": 5639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I needed change. I applied for more Astro postdocs, but also for other jobs I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190519,
    "dDurationMs": 5389,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ended up having two good offers one was still in Melbourne, but in bioinformatics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196639,
    "dDurationMs": 6380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the information science of genetics turns out many many other fields science and otherwise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203389,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Want the analytical skills of all brands of physicists?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207109,
    "dDurationMs": 4279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other offer was an astrophysics postdoc at Columbia University in New York"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211939,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do I switch careers or switch cities?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215900,
    "dDurationMs": 3979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, is there a very tough question, but I'd always wanted to live in New York"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219879,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I set sail again the real career hurdle was still ahead getting that permanent job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226370,
    "dDurationMs": 2329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where the numbers are against us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229040,
    "dDurationMs": 5029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are way more astro postdocs than permanent positions whether at universities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234470,
    "dDurationMs": 4909,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Observatories NASA or private foundations in my case. I got lucky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239769,
    "dDurationMs": 3059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I scored a professorship at the City University of New York"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243169,
    "dDurationMs": 5809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that was the first point in my entire career where I thought I might be able to stick with this gig. Oh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249530,
    "dDurationMs": 7699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I started making YouTube videos because God forbid I take it easy for a bit if you're thinking about pursuing physics or astrophysics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257630,
    "dDurationMs": 5119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact many of the hard sciences then your path might look similar to mine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263480,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to focus on the first part of the process getting into a ph.d program"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268680,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Getting your PhD is pretty much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271080,
    "dDurationMs": 6829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Non-negotiable there are jobs for those with just undergraduate or masters degrees, but the prospects are relatively scarce"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278790,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me also say right now that it's never too late to start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283010,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know people who started in their 30s 40s 50s even 60s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287880,
    "dDurationMs": 7130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most are much more sure of their goals than a fresh college graduate and so often have much more focus and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295410,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Determination and they can do very well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298350,
    "dDurationMs": 650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299000,
    "dDurationMs": 5850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your focus is convincing some folk on a missions committee to actually pay you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305160,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To come to a PhD at their University"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308190,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first step is to take a ton of mathematics and physics as an undergraduate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314100,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most estra PhD programs require a good foundation in the fundamentals of modern physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320010,
    "dDurationMs": 6739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't really matter what you major in but by the time you've taken all of that physics you probably qualify for a physics major"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326940,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, and while you're at it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329250,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Get good grades"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330620,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm afraid this one isn't negotiable either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333960,
    "dDurationMs": 6259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Graduate admissions committees are looking for A's and B's a few lower grades won't kill you, but don't make a habit of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340350,
    "dDurationMs": 6350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll also want to put serious effort into whatever standardized test. Your country has the GRE in the u.s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347070,
    "dDurationMs": 6260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now me saying get good grades might sound glib but it's important to emphasize for one thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353790,
    "dDurationMs": 4519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Admissions committees folk have to sift through up to hundreds of applications each year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358590,
    "dDurationMs": 4879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of them will filter by your grades before they read your nice personal essay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363810,
    "dDurationMs": 6380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also working your butt off as an undergraduate will help you learn whether a life in science is really for you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370500,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may end up finding out that your talents lie elsewhere and that's fine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374370,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at least you'll know that you gave it your best shot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377160,
    "dDurationMs": 3649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other thing to do as an undergrad is try to do some research"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381210,
    "dDurationMs": 5119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Commence a prof at your University to give you a small project that looks good on your application"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386370,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It should get you a letter of recommendation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388230,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From that prof but most importantly it'll help you figure out if you actually like research"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393630,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You should also apply for various REU programs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397190,
    "dDurationMs": 5929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are research experience for undergraduate programs, and they may actually pay you to do research between semesters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403640,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404660,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely critical thing to do as an undergraduate is find a mentor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408920,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This could be the prof you're doing research with or just another faculty member or even a postdoc you can talk to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415130,
    "dDurationMs": 6350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't proceed blindly get as much advice as you can. Okay, so it's time to apply to grad school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422240,
    "dDurationMs": 5059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Research different graduate programs by doing stuff you're interested in at that University"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427610,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would you be cool moving to that CDU or even country?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431480,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't just apply to top-tier schools. There are many truly excellent grad programs that don't have I've been growing on the walls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440270,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Visit campuses talk to profs and students there if you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444200,
    "dDurationMs": 6980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are a lot of resources online for how to craft a good application use them send out a bunch of applications"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451910,
    "dDurationMs": 2989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hopefully you'll get some bias. If not don't despair"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454940,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can bolster your application for the next year do some more undergraduate research"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459830,
    "dDurationMs": 6589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Retake the GRE exam or equivalent look into bridge or master programs. These can help prep you for grad school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467090,
    "dDurationMs": 7250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, I would not recommend paying lots of money out of pocket to do a master's program just to improve your chance of getting into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474340,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a ph.d program at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476150,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any point keep your mind open about other career paths?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480620,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are so many cool things to do out there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483170,
    "dDurationMs": 4670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Especially if you have a good science undergrad degree once you're in a ph.d program"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487840,
    "dDurationMs": 5729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you'll have access to many new mentors who can give you as good advice as I can or better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494210,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Find those mentors it's going to be a challenging time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497240,
    "dDurationMs": 2329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it will Forge you into a scientist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499970,
    "dDurationMs": 6259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One piece of advice regarding grad school to find the straightest path to patching together a thesis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507200,
    "dDurationMs": 6619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Writing this tome may seem daunting, but you have much much cooler work ahead of you. Just get it done"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514370,
    "dDurationMs": 6470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because once you have that PhD your options open up massively both in the field and out of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520910,
    "dDurationMs": 2779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, this gets me to the big question"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524420,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should you pursue a PhD?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527030,
    "dDurationMs": 4669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reasons to do it you want to spend your life answered the biggest questions there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531699,
    "dDurationMs": 6270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you want to gaze upon the wonders of the universe and bring this incredible perspective to enrich humanity?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539029,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you just have to know how it all works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541670,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all good reasons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543110,
    "dDurationMs": 6739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To spend a decade in school for pretty average pay the reasons not to do a PhD are many"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550399,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't do it because you think you're okay at math and can't think of anything else to do besides stay in school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556250,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't do it if you want to earn the big bucks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558319,
    "dDurationMs": 5150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't do it. If you don't want to have to move city or country every few years until you get that permanent job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563629,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't do it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564459,
    "dDurationMs": 3809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you want to maintain the illusion that you're the smartest person in the room and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568759,
    "dDurationMs": 5390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't do it because you like the idea of yourself as a scientist more than you like doing science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574490,
    "dDurationMs": 6769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fact is with the job situation as it is the odds are stacked against getting that permanent position"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581420,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you better love the journey and all the awesome science you get to do along the way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586879,
    "dDurationMs": 6770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The job includes as much or more frustration and boring stuff as it does on locking the mysteries of the universe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594290,
    "dDurationMs": 3229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've got to love the latter enough to get through the former"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598430,
    "dDurationMs": 2899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't do a PhD because you want to be an astrophysicist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602240,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do it because you want to do astrophysics at least for a while. Okay enough rambling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609230,
    "dDurationMs": 5929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Myself and other poor suckers on this path will answer specific questions in the comments for now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615470,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's get on with it and do some actual astrophysics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618310,
    "dDurationMs": 4829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a challenge question based on our recent episodes on cosmic inflation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623600,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll definitely need to have watched those to get this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628040,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In those episodes we saw how an inflating universe can produce bubbles in which inflation stops"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634730,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each a newly born universe in eternal inflation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639019,
    "dDurationMs": 7010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This process goes on forever but inflation also has a beginning. So how many bubble universes exist today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646910,
    "dDurationMs": 2059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that's not something we can easily calculate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649730,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is something we can at least estimate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652240,
    "dDurationMs": 6690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's assume that every second there's a set chance of the new universe forming in any given volume of space"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659240,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So every second many bubble universes are forming across the great sir"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664140,
    "dDurationMs": 6859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eternally, inflating space-time and every second more universes form than in the previous second because there's more volume"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671820,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my question is this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674040,
    "dDurationMs": 7910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compared to the number of universes that formed this second how many more universes form in the following second twice as many a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682230,
    "dDurationMs": 5359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thousand times as many less more to answer this you'll need to assume a rate for inflation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688020,
    "dDurationMs": 5150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's assume the minimum rate needed to explain the horizon and flatness problems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693300,
    "dDurationMs": 4159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is all distance is increased by a factor of 10 to the power of 26"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697830,
    "dDurationMs": 6169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every 10 to the power of negative 32 seconds and an extra credit question at that rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704430,
    "dDurationMs": 7130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How close to our universe would a new bubble universe need to form in order for the two bubbles to collide?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711990,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before inflation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713340,
    "dDurationMs": 2929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Throws them too far apart write up your answers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716270,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Neatly show all of your work and draw some nice diagrams if you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720420,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Submit answers within two weeks of release of this episode to PBS space time at gmail.com with the subject line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727230,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eternal inflation challenge and check your spelling because we filter by subject line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732270,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll select six correct answers to win your pick of space-time merch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737340,
    "dDurationMs": 7309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the merch store as well as the conference of the degree of doctor of space-time, which won't get you any professorships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744690,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But your parents will be so proud or if you hate homework, you can just buy that merch link in the description"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751500,
    "dDurationMs": 2029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll announce the winners in an upcoming episode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754050,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we will also learn some of the crazier consequences of an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759390,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eternally inflating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761010,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "space-time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771810,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You you"
    } ]
  } ]
